  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Fig. 6, 'Workflow B: plan service delivery business process', in one lane (vaccination location, health worker). From Start: 1. review past vaccination records to estimate vaccines needed; 2. record details on planning sheet; 3. sufficient stock in immediate location? If no, 4. order additional stock (a grey subprocess not covered by this kit); then 5. get needed stock; 6. record stock taken; 7. assemble all needed materials for the immunization session; End.",
